    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The historic Ephraim Square hosts the Ephraim Co‑op, the Old Granary Art Center, and the Bishop’s Storehouse, all preserved as part of the town’s heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
